    {
      "id": "checks",
      "title": "To shorten the wait, what should be checked first?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Log `cache=hit` or `cache=miss` so the two request paths can be told apart.",
            "Measure GET, SQL and SET durations separately and fix the slowest stage first.",
            "Check the SQL indexes and execution plan; before moving to an asynchronous write-back, design the recovery path for a failed write."
          ],
